@startuml dsp-negotiation-sequence
title DSP contract negotiation with the EHDS data permit, as a sequence\nRegulation (EU) 2025/327 Chapter IV first, then the Dataspace Protocol
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #475569
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBorderColor #64748B
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

participant "Health data user\nconsumer connector" as DU
participant "Federated catalogue\nHealthDCAT-AP" as CAT
participant "Health data access body\nHDAB" as HDAB
participant "Health data holder\nprovider connector" as DH

DU -> CAT : query the catalogue
CAT --> DU : dataset metadata and access policies
DU -> HDAB : apply for data (Art. 67)
HDAB -> HDAB : assess: purpose (Art. 53), not prohibited (Art. 54),\napplicant verified
HDAB --> DU : data permit (Art. 68), as a verifiable credential;\nrecorded in the public register (Art. 58)
DU -> DH : contract negotiation request (DSP),\nwith the permit credential
DH -> DH : verify the permit credential (DCP)
DH -> DH : evaluate the ODRL access policy
DH --> DU : contract agreement
DU -> DH : transfer request
DH --> DU : data transfer (FHIR or OMOP)
note over DH, DU
  Sovereign data exchange with a full audit trail;
  the data plane serves only what the agreement covers.
end note
@enduml
